        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "Can People Become Overgrown with Weeds Too?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_title_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:01+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ktkP7Nsj67dw2zcplQYt",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Why are you up already?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_001_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:05+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "I was thinking about your construction site.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_002_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:08+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "What's the point of thinking about that?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_003_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:11+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "The buildings at the site were torn down, leaving bare soil behind. Leave it alone for a few months, and weeds start growing.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_004_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:13+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "And here's the poetic angle: if a person were left untended for a few months, would they become overgrown with weeds too?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_005_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:17+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "But for a person, what would the soil be? And what would the weeds be?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_006_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:19+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Now I want to go pick some foxtail grass.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_007_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:22+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "child"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "zh-CN-mandarin",
      "code": "zh-CN",
      "language": "汉语",
      "variant": "普通话",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "人也会长满草吗",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "为什么起来了？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我想起你的工地了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "想这个有什么用？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "工地拆了房子，留下那些土在上面。几个月不打理就长草了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "然后诗人的角度就是：人几个月不打理，是不是也会长满了草？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "但对于人来说，什么是土呢？然后什么是草呢？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我都想去摘狗尾巴草了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_007_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "es-ES-elevenlabs",
      "code": "es-ES",
      "language": "西班牙语",
      "variant": "西班牙本土西语",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "¿Las personas también pueden llenarse de maleza?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_title_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:47:12+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ZCh4e9eZSUf41K4cmCEL",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¿Por qué te has levantado ya?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_001_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:47:13+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Estaba pensando en tu obra.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_002_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:47:15+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¿De qué sirve pensar en eso?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_003_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:47:16+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Derribaron los edificios de la obra y dejaron la tierra al descubierto. Si nadie la cuida durante unos meses, empieza a crecer maleza.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_004_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:47:22+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Y, desde un punto de vista poético: si una persona pasara varios meses sin cuidarse, ¿también se llenaría de maleza?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_005_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:47:25+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Pero, para una persona, ¿qué sería la tierra? ¿Y qué sería la hierba?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_006_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:47:27+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Ahora hasta me apetece ir a recoger cola de zorro.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_007_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:47:28+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "child"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "fr-FR-elevenlabs",
      "code": "fr-FR",
      "language": "法语",
      "variant": "法国法语",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "Les gens peuvent-ils aussi être envahis par les herbes ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_title_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:48:53+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "aQROLel5sQbj1vuIVi6B",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Pourquoi tu es déjà debout ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_001_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:48:54+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Je pensais à ton chantier.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_002_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:48:56+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "À quoi ça sert d'y penser ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_003_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:48:57+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Les bâtiments du chantier ont été démolis, laissant la terre à nu. Si on ne s'en occupe pas pendant quelques mois, les herbes se mettent à pousser.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_004_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:49:01+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Et d'un point de vue poétique : si personne ne prenait soin d'une personne pendant quelques mois, serait-elle aussi envahie par les herbes ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_005_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:49:04+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Mais pour une personne, que représenterait la terre ? Et que représenteraient les herbes ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_006_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:49:06+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
